 "text": "Hi, how are you doing right now? Try using small wood fire starter first, then switch to it once it' going. It gives you more control and doesn't make a lot of noise. Yes, they're great for starting tinder without all the dust. Of course. Put a small one in each pocket and one near the fire bed. Big enough that you can sit away from it on dry ground. Rough stuff it up and pack it away from the fire, so it doesn't catch leaving night. A good layer of ash helps to suppress smoke.",
